📖 Project Overview
This project demonstrates how to leverage mobile-based data collection tools, cloud storage, and GIS visualization for efficient field surveys and decision-making.
Using ODK Collect, Google Sheets,and Google My Maps, the project offers a cost-effective, customizable solution for collecting, managing, and visualizing field data.
The workflow includes designing structured survey forms, gathering geospatial data, processing it, and visualizing it on interactive maps, 
making it a perfect solution for field-based projects like resource mapping, monitoring, and spatial analysis.


🚀 Project Features
Customizable Field Survey Forms
    Designed and deployed mobile-friendly forms using ODK Collect for data collection.
Data Management & Analysis
    Managed collected data using Google Sheets and Excel for streamlined analysis.
Seamless Data Export
    Processed and exported survey data using ODK Converter for GIS compatibility.
Interactive Web Mapping
    Published field data with geospatial context using Google My Maps.
Geotagged Images for Visualization
    Enhanced maps by adding geotagged images with location-based keywords.


